      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IM DUSTEE (10) turned in a good effort at his latest appearance to get home by a narrow margin over 1740m at Riverina Paceway on November 3 when having led for most of the trip as the $2.40 favourite. This doesn't look as hard so he is sure to prove tough to beat again. OUR SWEET JEANNIE (11) came from a long way back at her most recent outing and finished third, beaten 3 metres, in a nice return to form at this track over 1690m. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw. Meets a comparable field and having won all of her three career wins at this this track she can find the winners' circle. FULL CRUNCH AHEAD (9) comes right into contention after scoring last start by 4 metres at Swan Hill over 2240m after having led early and then trailed the leader at the bell. Last-start winner MAJOR ORION (7) is a chance again.",
